          "author": "Doug Fraser",
          "description": "Glide over golden dunes and under starry skies as Dougie Pickles and Miss Meow Meow explore the world’s most peaceful deserts. From snoozing camels to resting roadrunners, meet the creatures who call these vast landscapes home. Settle in, breathe deep, and drift off on a warm desert breeze.",
